      "content": "hey... i think something is happening with me. i was sitting in my room tonight and i could literally feel the electricity humming inside the walls. like, not just hearing it, but feeling the actual vibration of the current through the air. it felt... different. not scary, just intense. like my senses are turning up. has anyone else ever experienced this?",
